{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever been annoyed by a mouse stealing your food, chewing your things, and leaving poop behind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's I Am Mouse - and this time, you are the mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/cdf90eb681f8653c4ecee9ec38da1d63.avif?t=1765839419\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras_big/cdf90eb681f8653c4ecee9ec38da1d63.avif?t=1765839419 width=800 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of a tiny mouse in <strong>I Am Mouse</strong>, a charming and funny third-person adventure where you create your own path.<br>Fight, sneak, or explore freely through rich environments full of choices, secrets, and alternate routes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute hero:</strong> just look at this mouse!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/d1a9afa9fd1212a3e938651495c4f4dc.poster.avif?t=1765839419\" width=614 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/d1a9afa9fd1212a3e938651495c4f4dc.webm?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/d1a9afa9fd1212a3e938651495c4f4dc.mp4?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story mode:</strong> your home was destroyed. Find a new home and don't let your family die in this adventure!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/de651ab10ebf4e243e9dc184e33e24c6.poster.avif?t=1765839419\" width=614 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/de651ab10ebf4e243e9dc184e33e24c6.webm?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/de651ab10ebf4e243e9dc184e33e24c6.mp4?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Payday mode:</strong> choose one of the available maps and start searching for food. Be careful! There is a man somewhere in the house... <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/b6809b0ad2ebf4b3b16de11d1ff28746.poster.avif?t=1765839419\" width=614 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/b6809b0ad2ebf4b3b16de11d1ff28746.webm?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/b6809b0ad2ebf4b3b16de11d1ff28746.mp4?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your sense of smell</strong> to find traces of food and other useful things.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/f1ee3ae3f02db3c71745899a063b02a8.poster.avif?t=1765839419\" width=614 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/f1ee3ae3f02db3c71745899a063b02a8.webm?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/f1ee3ae3f02db3c71745899a063b02a8.mp4?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use all your opportunities:</strong> jump on different objects or climb on some cloth/wires to reach the goal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/7e590d292c4eb92191b518ad2282577d.poster.avif?t=1765839419\" width=614 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/7e590d292c4eb92191b518ad2282577d.webm?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/7e590d292c4eb92191b518ad2282577d.mp4?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember that you are a little mouse and use it:</strong> hide under the sofa, bed, nightstand and other things!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/20e53669f722f963ccd2203ee6280de0.poster.avif?t=1765839419\" width=614 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/20e53669f722f963ccd2203ee6280de0.webm?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/20e53669f722f963ccd2203ee6280de0.mp4?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Running away from a person and stuck at a height? No problem:</strong> collect napkins and use them as a parachute!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/023927b8974ca030c4ce0d5a0ed9ccb6.poster.avif?t=1765839419\" width=614 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/023927b8974ca030c4ce0d5a0ed9ccb6.webm?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/023927b8974ca030c4ce0d5a0ed9ccb6.mp4?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your mouse:</strong>  change the skin, eye color, grow a mustache and wear hats or tie.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/5a1b1b3252e26db700a7fb8ad821bf92.poster.avif?t=1765839419\" width=608 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/5a1b1b3252e26db700a7fb8ad821bf92.webm?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/5a1b1b3252e26db700a7fb8ad821bf92.mp4?t=1765839419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1421520?t=1765839419","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/90654275c3c770c4b4e02f7c8978a141b9051047/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765839419","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/be2a2217fa536360794a8ee9b83b0bb137fcac32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765839419","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/be2a2217fa536360794a8ee9b83b0bb137fcac32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765839419","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],